{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 10, "ref": "1-kings 12:10", "book": "1-kings", "lang": "sv", "chapter": 12, "translation": "Och de unga männen som hade vuxit upp ⟨את⟩ med honom talade till honom och sade: Så skall du tala till detta folk som har talat till dig och sagt: Din far gjorde ⟨את⟩ vårt ok tungt, men du — gör det lättare för oss. Så skall du tala till dem: Mitt lillfinger är tjockare än min fars länder.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וידברו", "gloss": "Och de talade"}, {"surface": "אליו", "gloss": "till honom"}, {"surface": "הילדים", "gloss": "de unga männen"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "som"}, {"surface": "גדלו", "gloss": "hade vuxit upp"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ med honom"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "כה", "gloss": "Så"}, {"surface": "תאמר", "gloss": "skall du tala"}, {"surface": "לעם", "gloss": "till folk"}, {"surface": "הזה", "gloss": "detta"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "som"}, {"surface": "דברו", "gloss": "har talat"}, {"surface": "אליך", "gloss": "till dig"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "och sagt"}, {"surface": "אביך", "gloss": "Din far"}, {"surface": "הכביד", "gloss": "gjorde tungt"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "vårt ok"}, {"surface": "עלנו", "gloss": "vårt ok"}, {"surface": "ואתה", "gloss": "men du"}, {"surface": "הקל", "gloss": "gör lättare"}, {"surface": "מעלינו", "gloss": "för oss"}, {"surface": "כה", "gloss": "Så"}, {"surface": "תדבר", "gloss": "skall du tala"}, {"surface": "אליהם", "gloss": "till dem"}, {"surface": "קטני", "gloss": "Mitt lillfinger"}, {"surface": "עבה", "gloss": "är tjockare"}, {"surface": "ממתני", "gloss": "än min fars länder"}, {"surface": "אבי", "gloss": "min fars"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:28:53.217228928Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}